@startuml
!includeurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/stdlib/master/component/
title F1 Betting Game - Component Diagram

component "Angular SPA (Presentation)" as SPA
component "ASP.NET Core Web API (Presentation)" as API
component "Application Layer" as AppLayer
component "Domain Layer" as Domain
component "Infrastructure Layer" as Infra
component "Database (SQL Server)" as DB
component "OpenF1 Client" as OpenF1

' API Gateway / Controllers -> Application Layer
SPA --> API : HTTP Calls (REST)
API --> AppLayer : Invokes Service Calls

' Application Layer contains Use Cases/Business Logic
AppLayer --> Domain : Uses Domain Entities/Rules

' Domain Layer is the Core (Stable)
Domain --> Infra : Defines Repository Interfaces
Domain <.. Entity : Core Entities

' Infrastructure Layer implements persistence and external communication
Infra --> DB : Implements Repositories (EF Core)
Infra --> OpenF1 : Integrates via OpenF1Client

' Relationships Flow
API --> AppLayer : Exposes API Endpoints
AppLayer --> Infra : Interacts with Infrastructure components (e.g., Data Access)
Infra --> Domain : Accesses Domain objects

' External Dependency
OpenF1 ..> Infra : Uses/Integrates with API
@enduml